Subject: [PATCH] 5286: a refused second-circle number names who can introduce
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Lika №181: Netai rightly kept a second-circle person's number back, but
offered no introduction. The refusal already said „Offer
request_introduction instead" and named nobody to go through.

get_own_contact_number's refusal now carries introduce_through: up to three
of the owner's own contacts on Netai who have that number saved, in the
owner's spelling. The sentence is unchanged; the field is left out when
there is nobody. A failed read gives an empty list, never an error.

